    <string name="setting_gesture_help">Gesture Cheatsheet</string>
    <string name="gesture_help_body">• Tap app icon — launch app\n• Long-press app icon — rename / hide / app info / force stop / uninstall / add to folder / usage stats\n• Tap folder — open folder contents\n• Long-press folder — rename / dissolve\n\n• Tap ⚙ — open Settings\n• Long-press ⚙ — search apps\n\n• Tap WiFi icon — toggle (or open settings on Android 10+)\n• Long-press WiFi — open WiFi settings\n• Tap Bluetooth icon — toggle / open settings\n• Long-press Bluetooth — paired-devices quick-connect with last-used time\n• Tap Lock icon — lock screen\n• Long-press Lock — power menu (system apps only)\n\n• Tap clock — show time updates\n• Long-press clock — force E-ink screen refresh\n• Double-tap empty grid area — force refresh (same effect)\n\n• Swipe left on grid — next page\n• Swipe right on grid — previous page\n• Swipes starting near screen edge are passed to the system (Supernote side-bar etc.)\n\n• From any other app — long-press launcher icon for Lock / Search / Settings shortcuts</string>

