    <string name="about_description">E-Ink Launcher — a minimal launcher optimized for e-ink readers.\n\nFeatures:\n• App grid with adjustable density\n• Hide / sort apps\n• Lock screen and Wi-Fi / Bluetooth shortcuts\n• Custom icons (drop PNGs into Documents/E-Ink Launcher/icon)\n• Custom font and force language override</string>
